WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.760
Hello everybody!

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:03.760
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.760
Today we will do a new episode

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.360
of Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:15.120
Let's see what kind of challenges you have come up with this time!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.460
We have attached a racket to a stick

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.820
This is one of the world's longest table tennis rackets probably

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.660
Let's see if we can play with it.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.120
That's a really good spin actually!

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.300
Nice one!

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.300
I'm finding the rhytm!

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.300
It's like you would be canoeing!

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.700
Exactly!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.600
It's not working so well!

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:10.120
Next is an Instagram challenge from Jonny Winns

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.400
He wants us to play with a table

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:15.340
I think that it is the biggest racket that I have ever used!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:55.480
This is how you play table tennis with a table!

00:03:08.820 --> 00:03:10.820
I should have got that shot also

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.220
But no can do!

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.620
Last time we sliced an apple

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.280
This time we will try a banana!

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:24.660
No.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.840
This is not going to work.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:29.840
Nope.

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.420
It's not going to happen.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:46.980
I did it!

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:48.740
That was a perfect hit!

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.820
Look at that!

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:57.400
Straight in the middle!

00:03:57.640 --> 00:03:58.740
There is the banana!

00:03:58.940 --> 00:04:02.540
Remember to subscribe to our channel here

00:04:02.900 --> 00:04:05.400
And watch our previous videos there!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.400
Until next time!

